Package: dl2
Title: Composite Indicators by Metrics
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Eduardo", "Jimenez-Fernandez", , "edjimfer@ugr.es", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6108-527X"))
Description: Constructs DL2 composite indicators from weighted Minkowski distances. It provides optional polarity-aware Min-Max normalization with common bounds over the supplied full sample, iterative sequential Pena-Trapero weighting, standalone alternative factor estimators, and sensitivity analysis across norm orders using the iterative algorithm. The package has no runtime dependencies outside base R.
